     "titulo": "The adjective agrees with the noun",
     "texto": [
      "The adjective changes to agree with the noun in gender, number and case: **новый район** («new neighbourhood»), **в новом районе** («in the new neighbourhood»). The table shows the forms of **новый** with inanimate nouns."
